cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated article and this software release."
title: "Analysis code for transcriptomic efficiency and growth-defense trade-offs in alpine desert plants"
type: software
version: 1.0.0

authors:
  - family-names: "Gan"
    given-names: "Lu"

repository-code: "https://github.com/bluefirework16/transcriptomic-efficiency-alpine-plants"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - transcriptomics
  - alpine desert
  - experimental warming
  - watering
  - plant physiology
  - WGCNA
  - RNA-seq

abstract: >-
  R scripts and source data supporting analyses of physiological and
  transcriptomic responses of alpine desert plants to experimental warming
  and watering, including mixed-effects models, multivariate analyses,
  physiological-transcriptomic decoupling analysis, weighted gene
  co-expression network analysis, functional associations, and figure
  generation.
